# B1.89: card PRs append a row at the end of these tables, so two of them merged one after the other used to conflict
# on adjacent lines. union keeps both sides' lines; a row edited differently on both sides then comes back twice, and
# scripts/ci/check-features-map.sh and scripts/ci/check-backlog.sh name it. Union applies to the whole file.
# B1.96: the section index joins them (a card appends its § row; a closing flips one ✗ → ✅);
# scripts/ci/check-spec-sections.sh names a § kept twice.
spec/features-map.md merge=union
docs/metrics.md merge=union
spec/technical-requirements.md merge=union
